Test OCaml eval tool functionality

Note: each ocaml_eval call runs in a fresh `ocaml` process, so bindings do
not persist across calls. Only single-expression evaluations are tested.

Start the MCP server in the background
  $ ocaml-mcp-server --pipe test.sock --no-dune -vv &
